  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Tertiary Education for Employability Innovation and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Tertiary Education for Employability Innovation and Resilience (STEEIR) will seek to improve the employability of students and strengthen the quality and governance of tertiary education institutions. The project will focus on education, training and applied research on priority economic sectors (STEM, Digital Economy, Green, Health) and responding to development challenges such as climate change resilience including  renewable energy and water management. The proposed project scale the successful competitive funding approach and support new innovations in teaching and learning.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the employability of students and strengthen the quality and governance of higher education and scientific research institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
